+## Overview
+
+Total revenue across 30 orders was $7,154.44. The median order value was $204.94. Sales span four regions and four products.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads with $2,392.00 (33.4% of revenue), followed by Widget at $2,118.94. Doohickey earned $1,513.00 and Sprocket $1,130.50.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North is the top region at $2,176.35 (30.4%), with East at $1,830.79 and South at $1,732.48 close behind. West trails at $1,414.82 (19.8%).
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget inventory, since it generates the highest revenue at $2,392.00.
+- Investigate West's underperformance; at $1,414.82 it trails North by $761.53.
+- Bundle slower Sprocket sales with Widget orders to lift the $1,130.50 product line.
